{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02514","headline":"七夕赋咏成篇 · 陆敬","name":"七夕赋咏成篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夙驾鸣鸾啓阊阖，霓裳遥裔俨天津。\n五明霜纨开羽扇，百和香车动画轮。\n婉娈夜分能几许，靓妆冶服爲谁新。\n片时欢娱自有极，已复长望隔年人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆敬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}